Codec Test Frames (apps/web/src/lib/vnc/assets/)

  avc.bin  - H.264/AVC reference frame (x264 core 164)
  hevc.bin - H.265/HEVC reference frame (x265 build 199)
  av1.bin  - AV1 reference frame

  These small binary files (33-2405 bytes) are encoded test frames
  used to detect WebCodecs API codec support in the browser. They
  are not codec implementations. Sourced from the KasmVNC project.

